{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "826db0be-299f-888e-b1e8-326dc503b14d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-23T13:43:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lidia Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:41:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:41:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good afternoon. I need a replacement recycling bin, please. Is this the right department?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:41:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is, I can help with that. What's the address where the bin goes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:42:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 83 Bridge Street. In The Point. I am the landlord there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:42:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 83 Bridge Street. And what happened to the old bin, was it damaged, or missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:42:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is missing. The tenant says the wind took it, maybe last week. We cannot find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:42:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so a missing recycling bin at 83 Bridge Street. Let me put in the request. Is there a name I should put it under?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:42:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lidia Spencer. L-I-D-I-A, Spencer, like normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:42:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lidia Spencer. Got it. Now, I'll note it, but I can't tell you exactly what day the bin will come. It depends on when the truck brings them around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:42:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, one moment. I am writing down everything you say. So, the request is in, but no day yet? Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:42:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Request is in, no delivery day yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:43:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Then I would like a supervisor to call me back, please. To tell me the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:43:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can pass that along. What number should the supervisor use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:43:16-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0186."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:43:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's 401-555-0186. And is there a good time to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:43:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoon is better. Today or tomorrow, if possible?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:43:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note afternoons. With the holiday this week it might take a little bit, but I'll put it on the message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:43:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I understand. Thank you. I have it written down. Replacement bin, 83 Bridge Street, supervisor will call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:43:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. Thanks for calling, Ms. Spencer. Happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T13:43:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
